menu "Coffee Watch"
    config CW_LAUNCHER_APP
        bool "Run as an esp-launcher app (remote logs/commands; updates installed by the launcher)"
        default n
        help
            Starts the okou_agent SDK on the app's own Wi-Fi, exposes the serial console as the
            remote command `console`, and leaves firmware updates to esp-launcher. Requires the
            esp-launcher partition layout (partitions-launcher.csv).
endmenu
